{"id":1051004,"name":"ミリー・取り調べⅣ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"ミリー・取り調べⅣ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1051004]}],"trial":{"trial_id":51004,"stage":"段階4","unlock_time":"2025-09-23 14:00:00","diary1":"数ヶ月の時を経て、ついにあなたはMBCCに戻り、ミリーと対面で話せるようになった。彼女は緊張した面持ちで取り調べ室に座り、あなたの到着を待っている。この待ち望んだ面会は、果たして上手くいくだろうか？","diary2":"ミリーの話を聞き、あなたはかつてスラム街で救世主に祈っていた少女を思い出した。彼女は地獄のような試練を何度も乗り越え、自分の気持ちを確かめて、それを生き延びる力に変えたのだった。今となってはもう、あなたは彼女の愛を無視できない。それなら、一緒に行こう。もっと大きな世界を見て、より華やかな人生を経験するのだ。愛する人と共に。","evidence":[{"ID":260779,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260780,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":3,"dialogue_id":151004003,"next":[4,6]},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":1,"dialogue_id":151004007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":7,"dialogue_id":151004008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":3,"dialogue_id":151004015,"next":[16,17]},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004016,"next":[19]},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":151004023,"next"